    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q1">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 들어갈 말로 적절하지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Leberwurst</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 음료 명사
정답은 ②이다. trinken(마시다)의 목적어로는 음료가 와야 한다. Apfelsaft(사과주스), Wasser(물), Limonade(레모네이드)는 음료이지만, Leberwurst(간 소시지)는 음식이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Apfelsaft</choice_text>
          <commentary>음료이므로 적절하다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Leberwurst</choice_text>
          <commentary>음식이므로 적절하지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Wasser</choice_text>
          <commentary>음료이므로 적절하다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Limonade</choice_text>
          <commentary>음료이므로 적절하다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q2">
      <question_stem>A: Ich möchte jetzt schlafen. Kannst du mal das Licht __________?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>ausmachen</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 분리동사 ausmachen
정답은 ①이다. 자려고 하니 불을 꺼 달라는 상황이므로 das Licht ausmachen(불을 끄다)이 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>ausmachen</choice_text>
          <commentary>ausmachen(끄다)이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>anmachen</choice_text>
          <commentary>anmachen은 켜다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>aufmachen</choice_text>
          <commentary>aufmachen은 열다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>mitmachen</choice_text>
          <commentary>mitmachen은 함께하다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q3">
      <question_stem>Es ist schon 11 Uhr vormittags. Herr Bauer war sehr beschäftigt. Er hat heute noch nichts gegessen, denn er hatte keine Zeit zum ____________.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Frühstücken</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 명사화된 동사
정답은 ③이다. 오전 11시인데 아직 아무것도 먹지 못했다고 했으므로 아침 식사할 시간이 없었다는 의미의 zum Frühstücken이 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Duschen</choice_text>
          <commentary>샤워는 식사와 관련이 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Aufräumen</choice_text>
          <commentary>정리는 식사와 관련이 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Frühstücken</choice_text>
          <commentary>아침 식사이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Fernsehen</choice_text>
          <commentary>텔레비전 시청은 식사와 관련이 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q4">
      <question_stem>A: Wie lange dauert die Vorlesung?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Drei Stunden</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 기간을 묻는 wie lange
정답은 ②이다. Wie lange dauert ...?는 지속 시간을 묻는 표현이므로 Drei Stunden(3시간)이 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Sehr oft</choice_text>
          <commentary>빈도를 나타낸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Drei Stunden</choice_text>
          <commentary>기간을 나타내므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Manchmal</choice_text>
          <commentary>빈도를 나타낸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Am Dienstag</choice_text>
          <commentary>시점을 나타낸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="5" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q5">
      <question_stem>문을 닫아라. 춥다.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>닫아라</keyword>
        <keyword>춥다</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Mach die Tür zu. Mir ist kalt.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · Mir ist kalt
정답은 ①이다. '문을 닫아라'는 분리동사 zumachen의 명령형 Mach die Tür zu이다. 사람이 춥다고 느낄 때는 여격 비인칭 구문 Mir ist kalt를 쓴다. Ich bin kalt는 '나는 냉정한 사람이다'라는 뜻이 된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Mach die Tür zu. Mir ist kalt.</choice_text>
          <commentary>Mach die Tür zu. Mir ist kalt.이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Schließ die Tür zu. Ich bin kalt.</choice_text>
          <commentary>schließen은 zu와 함께 쓰지 않으며 Ich bin kalt도 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Schließ die Tür zu. Mir ist kalt.</choice_text>
          <commentary>schließen은 zu와 함께 쓰지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Mach die Tür zu. Ich bin kalt.</choice_text>
          <commentary>Ich bin kalt는 의미가 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q6">
      <question_stem>Angela는 Martin의 두 배만큼의 야채를 먹는다.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>배만큼</keyword>
        <keyword>야채</keyword>
        <keyword>먹는다</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Angela isst doppelt so viel Gemüse wie Martin.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 배수 비교
정답은 ②이다. 'A의 두 배만큼'은 doppelt so viel ... wie로 표현한다. 원급 비교는 so ... wie, 비교급은 als와 결합한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Angela isst zweit so viel Gemüse als Martin.</choice_text>
          <commentary>zweit는 쓰지 않으며 so ... als도 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Angela isst doppelt so viel Gemüse wie Martin.</choice_text>
          <commentary>doppelt so viel ... wie이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Angela isst zweit mehr Gemüse als Martin.</choice_text>
          <commentary>zweit mehr는 쓰지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Angela isst halb so viel Gemüse wie Martin.</choice_text>
          <commentary>halb so viel은 절반이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="7" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q7">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 쓰임이 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>쓰임</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Ich &lt;u&gt;habe&lt;/u&gt; meine Eltern am Flughafen abholen &lt;u&gt;müssen&lt;/u&gt;.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 완료형 조동사
정답은 ④이다. 상태 변화 자동사 einschlafen과 vergehen은 sein, 재귀동사 sich anziehen은 haben과 완료형을 만든다. 화법조동사가 본동사와 함께 쓰이면 완료형에서 이중 부정사(abholen müssen)가 된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Der Junge &lt;u&gt;hat&lt;/u&gt; gleich &lt;u&gt;eingeschlafen&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>ist eingeschlafen이 되어야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Meine Frau &lt;u&gt;ist&lt;/u&gt; sich warm &lt;u&gt;angezogen&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>hat sich angezogen이 되어야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Die Ferien &lt;u&gt;haben&lt;/u&gt; schnell &lt;u&gt;vergangen&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>sind vergangen이 되어야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Ich &lt;u&gt;habe&lt;/u&gt; meine Eltern am Flughafen abholen &lt;u&gt;müssen&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>이중 부정사 구문이 옳으므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q8">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 쓰임이 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>쓰임</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>&lt;u&gt;In die Tanzschule&lt;/u&gt; hatten wir viel Spaß.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 3·4격 지배 전치사
정답은 ③이다. in, vor, über 등은 방향이면 4격, 위치이면 3격을 쓴다. 댄스학원에서 즐거웠다는 것은 위치이므로 In der Tanzschule가 되어야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Das Auto fährt &lt;u&gt;vor den Eingang&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>입구 앞으로 이동하는 방향이므로 4격이 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Die Kinder laufen &lt;u&gt;über die Straße&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>길을 건너는 방향이므로 4격이 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>&lt;u&gt;In die Tanzschule&lt;/u&gt; hatten wir viel Spaß.</choice_text>
          <commentary>위치이므로 3격이 와야 해 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>&lt;u&gt;Nach dem Abitur&lt;/u&gt; wird er Student.</choice_text>
          <commentary>nach는 3격 지배로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="9" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q9">
      <question_stem>ⓐ ～ ⓒ에 들어갈 말로 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>machen Nehmt euch</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 인칭 변화와 명령형
정답은 ③이다. 주어 Monika und ich는 wir이므로 machen, 상대가 둘(ihr)이므로 명령형 Nehmt, 여격 대명사는 euch이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>machen Nehmt ihr</choice_text>
          <commentary>ⓒ가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>mache Nimmt dir</choice_text>
          <commentary>ⓐ, ⓑ, ⓒ가 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>machen Nehmt euch</choice_text>
          <commentary>machen, Nehmt, euch이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>macht Nimm ihr</choice_text>
          <commentary>ⓐ, ⓑ, ⓒ가 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="10" id="PRB-8A7BD507285948FF-Q10">
      <question_stem>문법적으로 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문법적</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>④ auf dem Abend</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · sich freuen auf
정답은 ④이다. 앞으로 있을 일을 고대할 때는 sich freuen auf + 4격을 쓰므로 auf den Abend가 되어야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>Peter hat sich sehr ④ auf dem Abend gefreut.</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>① ihm</choice_text>
